@startuml
title Smart Risk Assessment and Safety Resource Recommendation Module

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Times New Roman
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam ArrowColor #3F3F46
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.2
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #EAF3FA
  BorderColor #6B8EAD
  FontColor #20242A
  DiamondBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  DiamondBorderColor #20BFA9
  StartColor #000000
  EndColor #000000
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFF8D9
  BorderColor #D8B84B
  FontColor #40351A
}

|#F7E8F5|Event Organiser|
start
:Submit or resubmit\nevent application;

|#E7F1FB|Smart Risk Assessment and Safety Resource Recommendation Module|
:Retrieve application and contextual evidence\n(weather, public-holiday, venue, calendar,\nhistorical-event outcome, and closed and verified\nrelevant incident information from the\nIncident Reporting Module);
:Record evidence source and provenance;
:Validate required information and sufficient evidence;\ndetermine assessment readiness, compliance,\nand evidence confidence;

if (Can assessment proceed?) then (No)
  :Record warnings and mark\nreview required;
  :Create review-required handoff to the\nAuthority Approval and Notification Module;
  stop
else (Yes)
  |#E7F1FB|Smart Risk Assessment and Safety Resource Recommendation Module|
  :Prepare validated assessment package\nwith rubric, hard rules, and guidance;
endif

|#E9F8F5|MiniMax M3 — External AI Service|
:Identify hazards and propose\nlikelihood and severity scores;
:Return evidence, rationale, confidence,\nconcerns, and missing information;

|#E7F1FB|Smart Risk Assessment and Safety Resource Recommendation Module|
:Validate the MiniMax response;
if (AI response usable?) then (Yes)
  |#E7F1FB|Smart Risk Assessment and Safety Resource Recommendation Module|
  :Load active formula, category weights,\nthresholds, guideline checks, and versions;
  :Apply hard-rule constraints and retain\noriginal AI-proposed values;
  :Calculate provisional risk value\nfor each applicable category;
  :Apply category weights and calculate\nprovisional overall score;
  :Map provisional score to\nLow / Medium / High risk level;
  :Record score differences, warnings,\nand authority-review indicators;
  :Store provisional assessment\nand audit record;
else (No)
  :Record unavailable or retryable status;
  |#FDECEC|Authority Approval and Notification Module|
  :Receive Manual Review Required handoff;
  note right
    MiniMax is advisory only.
    Missing scores are never fabricated.
  end note
  stop
endif

|#FDECEC|Authority Approval and Notification Module|
:Authority assessment review is performed by\nthe Authority Approval and Notification Module;
:Return reviewed scores and decision audit details to the\nSmart Risk Assessment and Safety Resource Recommendation Module;

|#E7F1FB|Smart Risk Assessment and Safety Resource Recommendation Module|
:Receive authority-confirmed or\noverridden category scores;
:Recalculate official risk for each category\nusing the active formula and guideline checks;
:Apply active weights and thresholds and\ncalculate the official overall score;
:Map official score to\nLow / Medium / High risk level;
:Generate safety-resource baselines and planning ranges\nusing the official risk result, event characteristics,\nconfigured assumptions, and relevant guidelines;
:Store resource baselines, planning ranges, assumptions,\nguideline sources, authority sources, and provenance;
:Append each authority confirmation or override,\noverride reason, confirming user, and official result\nwithout overwriting the original values;
:Generate consolidated assessment outputs;
:Publish the role-restricted organiser-safe summary\nand detailed authority assessment record;

stop
@enduml
